            <div xml:id="d88">

                <pb facs="0091" n="79" sameAs="frus:frus1943v04/pg79"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.203/237: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Egypt</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Kirk</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cairo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-02-16T10:00:00+02:00">February 16,
                            1943—10 a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received February 16—7:45 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>352. It is essential that I have an immediate answer to the questions regarding
                    civilians raised in my 341 February 15, 11 a.m.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Kirk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
